Template for projects/<project>/<harness>/Images.v.

@@ file
(** * $project / $harness: the $count image$s

$header *)
From LinuxProcessSemantics.LinuxProcessSem Require Import MemImageType.
From $namespace.Core Require Import Images.
From $rocq.images Require $modules.

$definitions

$lemmas

@@ header
Each [images/<Build>.v] is generated when this library is built, by the [elf-snapshot] tool of linux-process-semantics, from the ELF file that harness.yaml pins by SHA-256.  It is not stored in this repository.  The [_wf] lemmas check by computation that each image is well formed ([$namespace.Core.Images]), so that no statement about it holds only because the image has no valid entry.

@@ definition
Definition $ident : Image := mkImage $module.M.loaded_segments $module.M.init_pc $module.M.phdrs.
@@ lemma
Lemma ${ident}_wf : image_wf $ident.  Proof. check_image_wf. Qed.
